00:11:31,083 --> 00:11:33,195
that has been running periodically.

210
00:11:33,195 --> 00:11:35,637
Is it giving me back good information?

211
00:11:35,637 --> 00:11:38,112
If the answer is yes, I got it back.

212
00:11:38,112 --> 00:11:39,234
Good information.

213
00:11:39,234 --> 00:11:43,623
It stays in the queue
as soon as I get unhealthy timeouts.

214
00:11:44,283 --> 00:11:46,791
Then I remove it from the the load

215
00:11:46,791 --> 00:11:49,794
balancing queue
and I decide what I'm going to do.

216
00:11:49,893 --> 00:11:52,896
There's lots of options
whether I say, hey,

